    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "A stay at White House Hotel London places you in the heart of London, within a 10-minute walk of Hyde Park and Kensington Gardens.  This hotel is 0.7 mi (1.1 km) from Marble Arch and 0.5 mi (0.8 km) from Paddington Central."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Stay in one of 15 guestrooms featuring flat-screen televisions. Bathrooms have showers and hair dryers. Conveniences include safes and desks, and housekeeping is provided daily."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EHyde Park - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Gardens - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Paddington Central - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Marble Arch - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Park Lane - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Baker Street - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Madame Tussauds Wax Museum - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Selfridges - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sherlock Holmes Museum - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Regent\u0027s Park - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Queensway - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Marylebone High Street - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington High Street - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Palace - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Royal Albert Hall - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 18 km / 11.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 27.8 km / 17.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 95.5 km / 59.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 50.7 km / 31.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Farnborough (FAB) - 63.5 km / 39.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for White House Hotel London is Seychelles Intl. Airport (SEZ). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
